ere laboratory-confirmed as positive.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"During December 1, 2023–April 14, 2024, among 343 NVO-positive specimens tested by CDC, no clade I MPXV infections were identified.\"}], \"confidence\": \"medium\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"study_design\"]}", "type": "text"}]}